Compare {{cog|da|telt}} (whence {{cog|en|tilt}} + native {{m|en|teld}} from {{cog|ang|teld}}), {{cog|dum|telt}}, {{cog|non|tjald|t=tent}} (whence {{cog|nb|tjeld}}).

